---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Disclaimer | CivicConnect" description="Read the legal disclaimer for CivicConnect.">
  <div class="py-24 px-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="text-caption-mono text-accent-sunset tracking-[0.15em] block mb-3">legal notice</span>
      <h1 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-4">Official Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="text-body-sm text-mute">Please read this notice carefully before using the assistant or directory pages.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-6 text-body-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
      
      <div class="p-6 border border-accent-sunset bg-canvas-card rounded-sm mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-body-md text-ink font-semibold mb-2">1. No Professional Legal Counsel</h2>
        <p class="text-body-sm text-mute">
          CivicConnect is an informational portal designed to help citizens locate government resources and understand general legal rules. **It does not provide legal representation or legal advice.** No attorney-client relationship is formed by using the AI assistant or reading these pages.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-body-md text-ink font-semibold mt-8">2. Accuracy and Completeness</h2>
      <p>
        While CivicConnect takes steps to retrieve official files and constrain summaries to actual government text, we cannot guarantee that every detail is complete, accurate, or fully up to date. Government regulations, scheme parameters, income ceilings, and document checklists change frequently. 
      </p>
      <p>
        Users are advised to treat all outputs as summaries to be cross-checked against original government publications.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-body-md text-ink font-semibold mt-8">3. Affiliation and Authority</h2>
      <p>
        CivicConnect is an independent private initiative. **It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or representing any government entity**, including the Government of India, state governments, or municipal corporations.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-body-md text-ink font-semibold mt-8">4. Liability Limitation</h2>
      <p>
        Under no circumstances shall the creators, developers, or partners of CivicConnect be liable for any direct or indirect damage or loss resulting from:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-mute">
        <li>Decisions made or actions taken in reliance on AI-generated summaries.</li>
        <li>Unavailability of government benefit schemes or change of eligibility rules.</li>
        <li>Filing delays or missed legal deadlines.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-body-md text-ink font-semibold mt-8">5. Direct Verification</h2>
      <p>
        We encourage users to click the source links provided in our citation drawers to inspect the original gazette or policy document, or visit an empaneled official or advocate for advice.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
